{
    "title": "Dil Ka Rishta",
    "description": "\u2764\ufe0fDil Ka Rishta\r\nPakistan's first matrimonial app that offers 100% verified profiles.\r\n\r\nIf you are single and looking for a life partner, or a parent seeking Rishtas for your son and daughter's shaadi, or you want to search for a partner for your friend, Dil Ka Rishta is the perfect platform for you. Find your compatible match and get married now by installing the app.\r\n\r\nDownload the Dill ka Rishta Matrimony App to take the initial step toward a Halal Marriage. Search for your soul mate among Pakistanis living in various countries, including the United Arab Emirates, Saudi Arabia, the United States of America, India, the United Kingdom, Canada, Australia, Oman, Qatar, Germany, Kuwait, Bahrain, France, Italy, Malaysia, and Spain.\r\n\r\nDill ka Rishta has made it easy to find a Rishta or life partner. Select your ideal life partner or a soul mate from among the various Muslim sects, including Shia, Deobandi, Brailvi, Wahabi, Abbasi, Sunnis, and others, including other religions\u00a0Christian, Hindu, Parsi, etc.\r\n\r\n\u2705Pakistan's First Matrimonial App with 100% Verified Profiles for marriage\r\nDil Ka Rishta is Pakistan's first matrimonial app for single Muslims that provides:\r\n\u2022 100% verified rishta profiles\r\n\u2022 100% secure and trusted services\r\n\u2022 100% compatible match\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd10Safe and Secure Relationship:\r\n\u2022 No phone number sharing without user consent\r\n\u2022 No screenshots are allowed\r\n\r\n2\ufe0f\u20e3   Two-Step Verification:\r\nOur app offers two-step verification for added security:\r\n\u2022 Phone call verification\r\n\u2022 In-home visit\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcacChat Safely:\r\n\u2022 Secure and private chat\r\n\u2022 Communicate without sharing mobile numbers\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0eSearch for Compatible Life Partners\r\nUsers can narrow down their search by using various filters like:\r\n\u2022 Education,\r\n\u2022 Community,\r\n\u2022 Profession,\r\n\u2022 Location, and many more.\r\n\r\n\u2705Get Verified for More Matches\r\n\u2022 Unlimited matches\r\n\u2022 More verified profile suggestions\r\n\u2022 Maximum requests\r\n\u2022 More compatible profiles\r\n\u2022 5x chances of finding a life partner\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc69\ud83c\udffc\u200d\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udc68\ud83c\udffcFinding Your Perfect Match\r\n\u2022 Provide a secure platform for Muslims in Pakistan to meet potential life partners for marriage\r\n\u2022 Shares 10 new profiles every day to find your life partner\r\n\u2022 Develop fulfilling and cherishing relationships for couples\r\n\u2022 Offer 100% verified rishta profiles\r\n\u2022 Help users find their compatible life partner with confidence\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8d\ud83d\udc8dFrom Single to Couple\r\nOur app promises to bring you one step closer to finding your life partner. Our dedicated matchmaking efforts ensure that mature people find the perfect match with ease to get married.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc6bCouples Success Stories\r\nDil Ka Rishta matrimonial app has been a trusted platform for millions of people across Pakistan looking to meet their perfect match for marriage.\r\n\r\n\"Dil Ka Rishta helped me find my soulmate. The two-step verification process gave me peace of mind. Last month, we had our nikah and I'm in a relationship now.\"Anam (Islamabad)\r\n\r\n\"I've tried other shaadi apps before, but Dil Ka Rishta stood out for its security and privacy features. The filter options helped me find my ideal partner with ease.\" Rashid (Lahore)\r\n\r\nFor marriage-minded singles - not dating\r\nDil Ka Rishta is not a dating platform. Instead, we focus on helping our users find a lifelong partner for marriage. Our app is designed to connect individuals who are serious about finding a compatible partner, rather than just casually dating.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc93Start Your Four-Step Shaadi Journey now:\r\nInstall the App\r\nCreate a Profile\r\nGet Yourself Verified\r\nSend request",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2764\ufe0fDil Ka Rishta<br>Pakistan&#39;s first matrimonial app that offers 100% verified profiles.<br><br>If you are single and looking for a life partner, or a parent seeking Rishtas for your son and daughter&#39;s shaadi, or you want to search for a partner for your friend, Dil Ka Rishta is the perfect platform for you. Find your compatible match and get married now by installing the app.<br><br>Download the Dill ka Rishta Matrimony App to take the initial step toward a Halal Marriage. Search for your soul mate among Pakistanis living in various countries, including the United Arab Emirates, Saudi Arabia, the United States of America, India, the United Kingdom, Canada, Australia, Oman, Qatar, Germany, Kuwait, Bahrain, France, Italy, Malaysia, and Spain.<br><br>Dill ka Rishta has made it easy to find a Rishta or life partner. Select your ideal life partner or a soul mate from among the various Muslim sects, including Shia, Deobandi, Brailvi, Wahabi, Abbasi, Sunnis, and others, including other religions\u00a0Christian, Hindu, Parsi, etc.<br><br>\u2705Pakistan&#39;s First Matrimonial App with 100% Verified Profiles for marriage<br>Dil Ka Rishta is Pakistan&#39;s first matrimonial app for single Muslims that provides:<br>\u2022 100% verified rishta profiles<br>\u2022 100% secure and trusted services<br>\u2022 100% compatible match<br><br>\ud83d\udd10Safe and Secure Relationship:<br>\u2022 No phone number sharing without user consent<br>\u2022 No screenshots are allowed<br><br>2\ufe0f\u20e3   Two-Step Verification:<br>Our app offers two-step verification for added security:<br>\u2022 Phone call verification<br>\u2022 In-home visit<br><br>\ud83d\udcacChat Safely:<br>\u2022 Secure and private chat<br>\u2022 Communicate without sharing mobile numbers<br><br>\ud83d\udd0eSearch for Compatible Life Partners<br>Users can narrow down their search by using various filters like:<br>\u2022 Education,<br>\u2022 Community,<br>\u2022 Profession,<br>\u2022 